{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794674603019,"sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","part":{"id":"prt_1daf1340b001kQGF1HmvtYyFFl","sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","messageID":"msg_1daf0a5a7001BgkzWImFJekQYS","type":"step-finish","reason":"tool-calls","snapshot":"df7faff0f8937ffb60242ec8d9911d7b4d8f48f6","cost":0.000800444,"tokens":{"input":893,"output":228,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"read":36992,"write":0}}}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794674604798,"sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","part":{"id":"prt_1daf13afe001lTinSTC1Bn1GBC","sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","messageID":"msg_1daf1341200159wwDczsXhra7e","type":"step-start","snapshot":"afb88f5439e948ff6bb8774b584639dd34e0eb97"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794674605569,"sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1daf13c80001lYvQ4VHyhRH018","sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","messageID":"msg_1daf1341200159wwDczsXhra7e","type":"tool","id":"wy1alr3v4","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/383-mistral-vibe-runtime && grep -n \"if_cli_mistral_vibe\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml | head; echo \"===SKILL===\"; sed -n '1,40p' .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-mistral-vibe/SKILL.md"},"output":"1223:        if_cli_mistral_vibe:\n===SKILL===\n---\nname: cli-mistral-vibe\ndescription: \"Mistral Vibe (vibe) CLI executor for pinned print-mode one-task dispatch over a closed two-alias DeepSeek and GLM roster.\"\nallowed-tools: [Bash, Read, Glob, Grep]\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# Mistral Vibe CLI Orchestrator - Cross-AI Task Delegation\n\n> **Experimental mode.** Print mode is pinned on vibe 3.1.2 from captures in this repository.\n> Both roster rows are hand-written, `allowed_models` closes the roster by model name, and ACP\n> (`vibe-acp`) is deferred.\n\nOrchestrate Mistral Vibe (`vibe`, uv tool package `mistral-vibe`) for one-task print-mode runs: a read-only review, a single scoped implementation or an independent second opinion, with the model fixed by a hand-written roster row.\nThe packet's one pin record is [cli-reference.md](./references/cli-reference.md) section 1, and every flag it names was captured from a 3.1.2 run or read from the code that writes the record.\nEach live result applies only to the route and behavior the saved capture exercised. Keep every behavior outside the saved captures marked UNKNOWN with the reason.\n\n**Core principle**: the model row owns reasoning effort, so the caller owns composition. Every dispatch names exactly one roster alias, runs print mode from a scratch cwd with a disposable `VIBE_HOME`, and counts as complete only when `export.json` records `exit_code` 0 and `outcome` `finished`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. WHEN TO USE\n\n### Activation Triggers\n\n- **Explicit Vibe dispatch**: the task names Mistral Vibe, `vibe` or `vibe -p`.\n- **Cross-AI validation**: an independent review or second opinion from a Vibe run that is not the calling runtime.\n- **One-task print-mode work**: a bounded task that answers once and exits, with `export.json` as the outcome record.\n- **Roster checks**: proving an alias resolves to a `mistral`-provider row with `thinking = \"max\"` before any model call.\n\n### When NOT to Use\n\n- `vibe` is not on PATH, or `vibe --version` does not print `vibe 3.1.2`.\n- `MISTRAL_API_KEY` is not exported in the child's environment.\n- The task needs ACP (`vibe-acp`), an interactive session, a human answer mid-run or a persistent client.\n- The task needs a model outside `deepseek-flash` and `glm-flash`, or reasoning effort other than the row's `max`.\n- The task needs the `.vibe/` runtime folder, a hook or the deep-loop executor kind, none of which this packet builds.\n- The only cwd available is the repository root.\n\n---\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1223:        if_cli_mistral_vibe:\n===SKILL===\n---\nname: cli-mistral-vibe\ndescription: \"Mistral Vibe (vibe) CLI executor for pinned print-mode one-task dispatch over a closed two-alias DeepSeek and GLM roster.\"\nallowed-tools: [Bash, Read, Glob, Grep]\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# Mistral Vibe CLI Orchestrator - Cross-AI Task Delegation\n\n> **Experimental mode.** Print mode is pinned on vibe 3.1.2 from captures in this repository.\n> Both roster rows are hand-written, `allowed_models` closes the roster by model name, and ACP\n> (`vibe-acp`) is deferred.\n\nOrchestrate Mistral Vibe (`vibe`, uv tool package `mistral-vibe`) for one-task print-mode runs: a read-only review, a single scoped implementation or an independent second opinion, with the model fixed by a hand-written roster row.\nThe packet's one pin record is [cli-reference.md](./references/cli-reference.md) section 1, and every flag it names was captured from a 3.1.2 run or read from the code that writes the record.\nEach live result applies only to the route and behavior the saved capture exercised. Keep every behavior outside the saved captures marked UNKNOWN with the reason.\n\n**Core principle**: the model row owns reasoning effort, so the caller owns composition. Every dispatch names exactly one roster alias, runs print mode from a scratch cwd with a disposable `VIBE_HOME`, and counts as complete only when `export.json` records `exit_code` 0 and `outcome` `finished`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. WHEN TO USE\n\n### Activation Triggers\n\n- **Explicit Vibe dispatch**: the task names Mistral Vibe, `vibe` or `vibe -p`.\n- **Cross-AI validation**: an independent review or second opinion from a Vibe run that is not the calling runtime.\n- **One-task print-mode work**: a bounded task that answers once and exits, with `export.json` as the outcome record.\n- **Roster checks**: proving an alias resolves to a `mistral`-provider row with `thinking = \"max\"` before any model call.\n\n### When NOT to Use\n\n- `vibe` is not on PATH, or `vibe --version` does not print `vibe 3.1.2`.\n- `MISTRAL_API_KEY` is not exported in the child's environment.\n- The task needs ACP (`vibe-acp`), an interactive session, a human answer mid-run or a persistent client.\n- The task needs a model outside `deepseek-flash` and `glm-flash`, or reasoning effort other than the row's `max`.\n- The task needs the `.vibe/` runtime folder, a hook or the deep-loop executor kind, none of which this packet builds.\n- The only cwd available is the repository root.\n\n---\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/383-mistral-vibe-runtime && grep -n \\\"if_cli_mistral_vibe\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml | head; echo \\\"===SKILL===\\\"; sed -n '1,40p' .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-mistral-vibe/SKILL.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794674605184,"end":1794674605569}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794674605576,"sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1daf13aff0020QxTtn6CYdpk3L","sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","messageID":"msg_1daf1341200159wwDczsXhra7e","type":"tool","id":"v31n9urxh","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/383-mistral-vibe-runtime && grep -n \"cli-mistral-vibe\\|VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS\\|isVibeSupportedModel\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts | head -20; echo \"===AUDIT===\"; grep -n \"VIBE\\|vibe\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts | head -20; echo \"===FANOUT===\"; grep -n \"buildVibeLineageCommand\\|export.json\\|vibe-rs\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs | head -20"},"output":"20:  'cli-mistral-vibe',\n141:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['model', 'timeoutSeconds', 'liveTools'],\n168:  'cli-mistral-vibe': false, // sandboxMode is not in EXECUTOR_KIND_FLAG_SUPPORT for this kind; the roster row decides what the model may reach\n229:  'cli-mistral-vibe': {\n301:export const VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS = ['deepseek-flash', 'glm-flash'] as const;\n302:export type VibeSupportedModel = typeof VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS[number];\n304:/** True when `model` is in the enforced cli-mistral-vibe allowlist. */\n305:export function isVibeSupportedModel(model: string): model is VibeSupportedModel {\n306:  return (VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS as readonly string[]).includes(model);\n705:  if (config.kind === 'cli-mistral-vibe' && config.model !== null && !isVibeSupportedModel(config.model)) {\n709:        message: `cli-mistral-vibe model '${config.model}' is not in the enforced allowlist: ${VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS.join(', ')}`,\n751:  'cli-mistral-vibe': false,\n===AUDIT===\n77:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['vibe', 'vibe-rs', 'vibe-app-server'],\n106:  // Vibe reads its own home override, so an inherited VIBE_HOME is lineage state and not\n108:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['SPECKIT_MISTRAL_VIBE_STATE_DIR', 'VIBE_HOME'],\n119:  'cli-mistral-vibe': '.vibe',\n172:  // Vibe's provider key and its own runtime variables share this prefix; VIBE_HOME also\n174:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['VIBE_'],\n188:  // Vibe authenticates its provider with this one key; VIBE_HOME is absent on purpose,\n190:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['MISTRAL_API_KEY'],\n197:  // An inherited VIBE_HOME points the leaf at the operator's Vibe state, while the runner\n199:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['VIBE_HOME'],\n===FANOUT===\n3116:    const parsed = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(lineageDir, 'vibe-output', 'export.json'), 'utf8'));\n3150:  if (!exportRecord) return `exited with code ${exitCode} without an export.json record`;\n3151:  return `exited with code ${exitCode} with export.json exit_code ${exportRecord.exit_code}`;\n3154:function buildVibeLineageCommand(lineage, prompt, resolvedSandbox, resolvedPermission, options) {\n3256:  'cli-mistral-vibe': buildVibeLineageCommand,\n4568:  buildVibeLineageCommand,\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"20:  'cli-mistral-vibe',\n141:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['model', 'timeoutSeconds', 'liveTools'],\n168:  'cli-mistral-vibe': false, // sandboxMode is not in EXECUTOR_KIND_FLAG_SUPPORT for this kind; the roster row decides what the model may reach\n229:  'cli-mistral-vibe': {\n301:export const VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS = ['deepseek-flash', 'glm-flash'] as const;\n302:export type VibeSupportedModel = typeof VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS[number];\n304:/** True when `model` is in the enforced cli-mistral-vibe allowlist. */\n305:export function isVibeSupportedModel(model: string): model is VibeSupportedModel {\n306:  return (VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS as readonly string[]).includes(model);\n705:  if (config.kind === 'cli-mistral-vibe' && config.model !== null && !isVibeSupportedModel(config.model)) {\n709:        message: `cli-mistral-vibe model '${config.model}' is not in the enforced allowlist: ${VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS.join(', ')}`,\n751:  'cli-mistral-vibe': false,\n===AUDIT===\n77:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['vibe', 'vibe-rs', 'vibe-app-server'],\n106:  // Vibe reads its own home override, so an inherited VIBE_HOME is lineage state and not\n108:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['SPECKIT_MISTRAL_VIBE_STATE_DIR', 'VIBE_HOME'],\n119:  'cli-mistral-vibe': '.vibe',\n172:  // Vibe's provider key and its own runtime variables share this prefix; VIBE_HOME also\n174:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['VIBE_'],\n188:  // Vibe authenticates its provider with this one key; VIBE_HOME is absent on purpose,\n190:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['MISTRAL_API_KEY'],\n197:  // An inherited VIBE_HOME points the leaf at the operator's Vibe state, while the runner\n199:  'cli-mistral-vibe': ['VIBE_HOME'],\n===FANOUT===\n3116:    const parsed = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(lineageDir, 'vibe-output', 'export.json'), 'utf8'));\n3150:  if (!exportRecord) return `exited with code ${exitCode} without an export.json record`;\n3151:  return `exited with code ${exitCode} with export.json exit_code ${exportRecord.exit_code}`;\n3154:function buildVibeLineageCommand(lineage, prompt, resolvedSandbox, resolvedPermission, options) {\n3256:  'cli-mistral-vibe': buildVibeLineageCommand,\n4568:  buildVibeLineageCommand,\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/383-mistral-vibe-runtime && grep -n \\\"cli-mistral-vibe\\\\|VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS\\\\|isVibeSupportedModel\\\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts | head -20; echo \\\"===AUDIT===\\\"; grep -n \\\"VIBE\\\\|vibe\\\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts | head -20; echo \\\"===FANOUT===\\\"; grep -n \\\"buildVibeLineageCommand\\\\|export.json\\\\|vibe-rs\\\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start