{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794674727313,"sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1daf31475001G19El60PeoQJft","sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","messageID":"msg_1daf30ad7001dvqC5JqC7TvRHu","type":"tool","id":"px139omc3","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/009-deep-loop-executor-kind/research/keyed-lineage-run/lineages/oc-1/deep-research-strategy.md","content":"# Deep Research Strategy - oc-1 Lineage\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nIn one short paragraph: what does the deep-loop executor kind `cli-mistral-vibe` add?\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n\n- [ ] What does the deep-loop executor kind cli-mistral-vibe add?\n- [ ] Which runtime surfaces change when the kind is added (executor config, audit allowlist, fan-out adapter, workflow branches)?\n- [ ] What isolation and scoring guarantees does a Vibe lineage get that no existing executor kind provides?\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Implementing or repairing the `cli-mistral-vibe` kind; this lineage reports findings only.\n- Re-litigating the Vibe CLI contract itself (phase 004) or the repo guards (phase 008).\n- Evaluating model quality of `deepseek-flash` or `glm-flash`.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- `config.maxIterations` (1) reached.\n- Convergence on `newInfoRatio` below 0.05.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n\n[None yet]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n## 7. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n## 8. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without success]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n\n---\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/009-deep-loop-executor-kind/research/keyed-lineage-run/lineages/oc-1/deep-research-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/009-deep-loop-executor-kind/research/keyed-lineage-run/lineages/oc-1/deep-research-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/009-deep-loop-executor-kind/research/keyed-lineage-run/lineages/oc-1/deep-research-strategy.md\", \"content\": \"# Deep Research Strategy - oc-1 Lineage\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nIn one short paragraph: what does the deep-loop executor kind `cli-mistral-vibe` add?\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\\n\\n- [ ] What does the deep-loop executor kind cli-mistral-vibe add?\\n- [ ] Which runtime surfaces change when the kind is added (executor config, audit allowlist, fan-out adapter, workflow branches)?\\n- [ ] What isolation and scoring guarantees does a Vibe lineage get that no existing executor kind provides?\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Implementing or repairing the `cli-mistral-vibe` kind; this lineage reports findings only.\\n- Re-litigating the Vibe CLI contract itself (phase 004) or the repo guards (phase 008).\\n- Evaluating model quality of `deepseek-flash` or `glm-flash`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- `config.maxIterations` (1) reached.\\n- Convergence on `newInfoRatio` below 0.05.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\\n\\n[None yet]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\\n## 7. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\\n## 8. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without success]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n\\n---\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\"}"},"time":{"start":1794674726005,"end":1794674727313}}}}
