{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794674761262,"sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1daf39713003vUiDu48730or1S","sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","messageID":"msg_1daf390f70017kZco8lLsi7cOb","type":"tool","id":"4g0lcfdb6","tool":"execute","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"code":"const S = \"fanout-oc-1-1794674533742-754r50\";\nconst ts = new Date().toISOString();\nconst iter = {\n  type: \"iteration\", iteration: 1, runId: S, sessionId: S, lineageId: S,\n  mode: \"research\", target_agent: \"deep-research\", agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: \"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\n  run: 1, status: \"complete\",\n  focus: \"What the cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind adds (as-built surface)\",\n  findingsCount: 8, newInfoRatio: 0.9,\n  noveltyJustification: \"All 8 findings are newly recorded facts for this lineage, discounted slightly to 0.90 because the phase spec already named the files and the intended change.\",\n  keyQuestions: [\n    \"What does the deep-loop executor kind cli-mistral-vibe add?\",\n    \"Which runtime surfaces change when the kind is added (executor config, audit allowlist, fan-out adapter, workflow branches)?\",\n    \"What isolation and scoring guarantees does a Vibe lineage get that no existing executor kind provides?\"\n  ],\n  answeredQuestions: [\"What does the deep-loop executor kind cli-mistral-vibe add?\"],\n  ruledOut: [\n    \"Reading the phase plan as the answer source instead of the as-built code\",\n    \"Evaluating model quality of deepseek-flash and glm-flash\"\n  ],\n  focusTrack: \"architecture\",\n  edgeCase: \"ambiguous-input\",\n  toolsUsed: [\"Read\", \"Grep\", \"Glob\", \"Bash\"],\n  sourcesQueried: [\n    \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/009-deep-loop-executor-kind/spec.md\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\",\n    \".skilled/skills/