{"type":"text","timestamp":1794674992785,"sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","part":{"id":"prt_1daf722d6001BTIVUs73nAuyP1","sessionID":"ses_e250f8270ffecHC0vrO03ZLgYJ","messageID":"msg_1daf71c590016HewZ2WKRaUf9w","type":"text","text":"All eight findings carry `[SOURCE: path:line]` citations (18 total; my earlier regex just didn't account for the two-space indent). Lineage is complete and verified on disk.\n\n## Iteration 1 Complete\n\n**Focus**: What the `cli-mistral-vibe` deep-loop executor kind adds (as-built surface)\n**Findings**: 8 (8 new, 0 partially new, 0 redundant)\n**newInfoRatio**: 0.90\n**Questions answered**: What does the deep-loop executor kind cli-mistral-vibe add?\n**Questions remaining**: 2\n**Edge cases**: ambiguous input (plan-intent vs as-built; as-built selected, plan-intent deferred)\n**Recommended next focus**: diff the `cli-mistral-vibe` rows against `cli-deepseek-harness` to separate Vibe-specific guarantees from shared adapter boilerplate\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-001.md`\n- `deltas/iter-001.jsonl` (11 lines: 1 iteration row + 8 finding rows + 2 ruled_out rows)\n- `research.md` (synthesis), `deep-research-config.json`, `deep-research-strategy.md`\n- Gateway receipts: run-initialized (seq 1), iteration-completed (seq 2), synthesis-complete (seq 3) — all exit 0\n- Reducer refreshed `findings-registry.json` and `deep-research-dashboard.md`\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- Gateway receipt (exit 0) + new projection records: 1 iteration record, 1 synthesis row\n- Findings citations complete: yes (18 `[SOURCE: path:line]` tags across 8 findings)\n- Packet boundary respected: yes — `git status` shows every new path under `lineages/oc-1/`\n- Reducer-owned files untouched by me: yes (reducer wrote them)\n\n**Status**: complete\n\nTwo things worth flagging for the merge reader. First, the reducer initially refused to rewrite the strategy because my hand-authored strategy was missing the `ruled-out-directions`, `divergence-frontier`, `carried-forward-open-questions` and `next-focus` anchors; I added them and re-ran, after which it wrote the strategy normally. Second, the terminal synthesis record needed three attempts: the gateway rejects a bare `{\"type\":\"synthesis\"}` row (`unknown-legacy-record`), then `{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\"}` (`legacy-event-has-no-lossless-mode-event`), and only accepts the `{stem, scope:{runId,lineageId}, data}` envelope that `synthesis-closeout.cjs` stages. The iteration record itself needed no such adjustment.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:oc-1","time":{"start":1794674991830,"end":1794674992785}}}
